53be2"><span class="relative translate-x-[10px] transition-transform duration-500 ease-in-out group-hover:-translate-x-2">Get Your Card</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right relative translate-x-2 opacity-0 transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out group-hover:translate-x-0 group-hover:opacity-100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed subpixel-antialiased text-14 aria-disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed border border-cream/50 text-cream disabled:opacity-40 hover:bg-navbar/70 rounded-full h-[46px] px-10 max-sm:flex-auto" data-zone="same" href="/cash">How It Works</a></div></div></div></div><div class="bg-copy/16 mt-10 h-px w-full lg:mt-0" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-6 lg:mt-[40px]"><div><div class="flex items-center gap-4 pb-5"><p class="text-copy/70 text-right text-base leading-[1.4]">Up to</p><p class="text-[48px] font-semibold leading-[56px] tracking-[-0.72px]">3%</p><p class="flex-1 text-base leading-[1.2]">cashback on all purchases</p></div><div class="bg-copy/16 h-px w-full" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><div><div class="flex items-center gap-4 pb-5"><div class="grid w-[120px] gap-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="61" height="24" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 61 24"><path fill="#FAF8F0" d="M12.053 4.645c.549 0 2.514.048 3.796 1.916-.11.085-2.063 1.184-2.063 3.65 0 2.856 2.49 3.87 2.563 3.894-.012.061-.402 1.38-1.306 2.734-.818 1.172-1.684 2.356-2.99 2.356s-1.648-.756-3.138-.756c-1.477 0-2.002.78-3.186.78-1.196 0-2.038-1.098-2.978-2.428C1.64 15.19.737 12.738.737 10.406c0-3.723 2.429-5.713 4.821-5.713 1.258 0 2.32.83 3.113.83.