 md:flex-row md:gap-[80px]"><div class="max-w-[476px] flex-1 space-y-8 md:space-y-12"><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)"><h2 class="text-tan font-crimson text-4xl leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.72px] lg:text-[48px]">Membership rewards that go beyond the card</h2></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)"><p class="text-base leading-[1.4]">Access rewards, global transfers, and premium financial services in one account.</p><ul class="mt-6 list-disc pl-6"><li class="text-base leading-[1.6]">Higher cashback with each tier</li><li class="text-base leading-[1.6]">Move money globally with bank transfers or crypto</li><li class="text-base leading-[1.6]">Hold USD or EUR with personal IBAN access</li><li class="text-base leading-[1.6]">Travel, lounge, and concierge perks</li><li class="text-base leading-[1.6]">Earn 5%+ APY on your account balance</li><li class="text-base leading-[1.6]">Borrow to spend without selling your assets</li></ul></div><div><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed subpixel-antialiased text-14 aria-disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed bg-tan text-[#0E0B31] disabled:opacity-40 h-11 hover:bg-[#B29568] rounded-full px-10 max-sm:w-full" data-zone="same" href="/the-club">Become a Member</a></div></div><div class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-center max-md:max-w-[200px]"><img alt="ether.fi membership" loading="lazy" width="2183" height="2126" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-auto w-full max-w-[240px]" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fmembership-icon.09v30rvfeklq0.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_7Ti7LWJ6KU5ZxfH85YxHLp6UiXK8 1x" src="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fmembership-icon.09v30rvfeklq0.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_7Ti7LWJ6KU5ZxfH85YxHLp6UiXK8"/></div></div></div><div class="mx-auto block max-w-[1048px] px-6 py-12 md:py-16 lg:py-28 overflow-clip"><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)"><h2 class="text-tan font-crimson pb-5 text-center text-4xl lg:text-5xl">Liquid puts your earnings on auto‑pilot</h2></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)"><p class="text-center text-lg">Automate your earnings with these strategy vaults</p></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)"><div class="flex justify-center py-8"><img alt="Tokens" loading="lazy" width="313" height="228" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Ftokens-img.0e6bf4-l1u9b0.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_7Ti7LWJ6KU5ZxfH85YxHLp6UiXK8 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Ftokens-img.0e6bf4-l1u9b0.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_7Ti7LWJ6KU5ZxfH85YxHLp6UiXK8 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Ftokens-img.0e6bf4-l1u9b0.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_7Ti7LWJ6KU5ZxfH85YxHLp6UiXK8"/></div></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-start"><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)"><h3 class="text-tan font-crimson pb-2 text-2xl lg:text-4xl">Deposit assets</h3><p>Whether your goal is to maximize your earnings on ETH, BTC, stablecoins, or just to get exposure to the latest in DeFi, there’s a vault for you.</p></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)"><h3 class="text-tan font-crimson pb-2 text-2xl lg:text-4xl">Auto-balance</h3><p>Liquid vaults will deploy strategy assets to optimize for earnings and additional rewards across the very best protocols in DeFi.</p></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)"><h3 class="text-tan font-crimson pb-2 text-2xl lg:text-4xl">Earn rewards</h3><p>Earnings are auto-compounded in the vault for you. Withdraw or transfer to other vaults with ease when you’re looking to change strategies.</p></div></div><div class="bg-copy/16 opacity-100 h-[1px] w-full max-w-full  " style="margin-block:1.25rem"></div><div class="flex flex