 text-4xl lg:text-5xl">See the latest from ether.fi</h2></div><div class="grid justify-center gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)"><div class="bg-navbar flex h-full max-w-[400px] flex-col items-center justify-between rounded-lg p-6 md:items-start"><img alt="Image Banner" loading="lazy" width="1170" height="780" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mb-4 h-auto w-full" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 400px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fufyao9jy%2Fproduction%2F9a0691674c25e1b06db1bea5870fac9745ca7b1f-1360x768.jpg%3Frect%3D104%2C0%2C1152%2C768%26w%3D1170%26h%3D780%26auto%3Dformat%26rev%3D2026-06-24T14%253A56%253A49Z&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fufyao9jy%2Fproduction%2F9a0691674c25e1b06db1bea5870fac9745ca7b1f-1360x768.jpg%3Frect%3D104%2C0%2C1152%2C768%26w%3D1170%26h%3D780%26auto%3Dformat%26rev%3D2026-06-24T14%253A56%253A49Z&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fufyao9jy%2Fproduction%2F9a0691674c25e1b06db1bea5870fac9745ca7b1f-1360x768.jpg%3Frect%3D104%2C0%2C1152%2C768%26w%3D1170%26h%3D780%26auto%3Dformat%26rev%3D2026-06-24T14%253A56%253A49Z&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fufyao9jy%2Fproduction%2F9a0691674c25e1b06db1bea5870fac9745ca7b1f-1360x768.jpg%3Frect%3D104%2C0%2C1152%2C768%26w%3D1170%26h%3D780%26auto%3Dformat%26rev%3D2026-06-24T14%253A56%253A49Z&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fufyao9jy%2Fproduction%2F9a0691674c25e1b06db1bea5870fac9745ca7b1f-1360x768.jpg%3Frect%3D104%2C0%2C1152%2C768%26w%3D1170%26h%3D780%26auto%3Dformat%26rev%3D2026-06-24T14%253A56%253A49Z&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fufyao9jy%2Fproduction%2F9a0691674c25e1b06db1bea5870fac9745ca7b1f-1360x768.jpg%3Frect%3D104%2C0%2C1152%2C768%26w%3D1170%26h%3D780%26auto%3Dformat%26rev%3D2026-06-24T14%253A56%253A49Z&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fufyao9jy%2Fproduction%2F9a0691674c25e1b06db1bea5870fac9745ca7b1f-1360x768.jpg%3Frect%3D104%2C0%2C1152%2C768%26w%3D1170%26h%3D780%26auto%3Dformat%26rev%3D2026-06-24T14%253A56%253A49Z&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fufyao9jy%2Fproduction%2F9a0691674c25e1b06db1bea5870fac9745ca7b1f-1360x768.jpg%3Frect%3D104%2C0%2C1152%2C768%26w%3D1170%26h%3D780%26auto%3Dformat%26rev%3D2026-06-24T14%253A56%253A49Z&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fufyao9jy%2Fproduction%2F9a0691674c25e1b06db1bea5870fac9745ca7b1f-1360x768.jpg%3Frect%3D104%2C0%2C1152%2C768%26w%3D1170%26h%3D780%26auto%3Dformat%26rev%3D2026-06-24T14%253A56%253A49Z&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><h3 class="font-crimson text-tan text-2xl">Non-custodial, actively defended: how ether.fi thinks about security</h3><p class="py-4 text-base">When an exploit hits a DeFi protocol, the window to prevent loss is measured in seconds. ether.fi is built, end to end, to use them. How non-custodial design and active defense work together across four layers.</p><div class="text-left"><a href="/blog/non-custodial-actively-defended" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed subpixel-antialiased text-14 aria-disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed border border-cream/50 text-cream disabled:opacity-40 h-11 hover:bg-navbar/70 rounded-full group px-6 md:px-10" data-zone="b99b5a"><span class="relative translate-x-[10px] transition-transform duration-500 ease-in-out group-hover:-translate-x-2">Keep reading</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right relative translate-x-2 opacity-0 transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out group-hover:translate-x-0 group-hover:opacity-100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)"><div class="bg-navbar flex h-full max-w-[400px] flex-col items-center justify-between rounded-lg p-6 md:items-start"><img alt="ether.fi shield logo with the title &#x27;How ether.fi Handled the redemption of 20% of TVL&#x27;" loading="lazy" width="1170" height="780" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mb-4 h-auto w-full" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 400px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fufyao9jy%2Fproduction%2Fa451753ca4a95a24c3f2595852707ce534232977-1360x768.jpg%3Frect%3D104%2C0%2C1152%2C768%26w%3D1170%26h%3D780%26auto%3Dformat%26rev%3D2026-06-24T10%253A55%253A18Z&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fufyao9jy%2Fproduction%2Fa451753ca4a95a24c3f2595852707ce534232977-1360x768.jpg%3Frect%3D104%2C0%2C1152%2C768%26w%3D1170%26h%3D780%26auto%3Dformat%26rev%3D2026-06-24T10%253A55%253A18Z&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fufyao9jy%2Fproduction%2Fa451753ca4a95a24c3f2595852707ce534232977-1360x768.jpg%3Frect%3D104%2C0%2C1152%2C768%26w%3D1170%26h%3D780%26auto%3Dformat%26rev%3D2026-06-24T10%253A55%253A18Z&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fufyao9jy%2Fproduction%2Fa451753ca4a95a24c3f2595852707ce534232977-1360x768.jpg%3Frect%3D104%2C0%2C1152%2C768%26w%3D1170%26h%3D780%26auto%3Dformat%26rev%3D2026-06-24T10%253A55%253A18Z&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fufyao9jy%2Fproduction%2Fa451753ca4a95a24c3f2595852707ce534232977-1360x768.jpg%3Frect%3D104%2C0%2C1152%2C768%26w%3D1170%26h%3D780%26auto%3Dformat%26rev%3D2026-06-24T10%253A55%253A18Z&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fufyao9jy%2Fproduction%2Fa451753ca4a95a24c3f2595852707ce534232977-1360x768.jpg%3Frect%3D104%2C0%2C1152%2C768%26w%3D1170%26h%3D780%26auto%3Dformat%26rev%3D2026-06-24T10%253A55%253A18Z&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fufyao9jy%2Fproduction%2Fa451753ca4a95a24c3f2595852707ce534232977-1360x768.jpg%3Frect%3D104%2C0%2C1152%2C768%26w%3D1170%26h%3D780%26auto%3Dformat%26rev%3D2026-06-24T10%253A55%253A18Z&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fufyao9jy%2Fproduction%2Fa451753ca4a95a24c3f2595852707ce534232977-1360x768.jpg%3Frect%3D104%2C0%2C1152%2C768%26w%3D1170%26h%3D780%26auto%3Dformat%26rev%3D2026-06-24T10%253A55%253A18Z&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fufyao9jy%2Fproduction%2Fa451753ca4a95a24c3f2595852707ce534232977-1360x768.jpg%3Frect%3D104%2C0%2C1152%2C768%26w%3D1170%26h%3D780%26auto%3Dformat%26rev%3D2026-06-24T10%253A55%253A18Z&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><h3 class="font-crimson text-tan text-2xl">How ether.fi Redeemed 20% of TVL Without Adding a Day to Ethereum&#x27;s Exit Queue</h3><p class="py-4 text-base">In 33 days, ether.fi redeemed 542,792 ETH, 19.6% of its TVL, during a market-wide rush for the exits. It did so without lengthening Ethereum&#x27;s shared exit queue for anyone else. Here&#x27;s how.</p><div class="text-left"><a href="/blog/how-ether-fi-redeemed-20-percent-of-tvl-without-adding-to-exit-queue" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed subpixel-antialiased text-14 aria-disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed border border-cream/50 text-cream disabled:opacity-40 h-11 hover:bg-navbar/70 rounded-full group px-6 md:px-10" data-zone="b99b5a"><span class="relative translate-x-[10px] transition-transform duration-500 ease-in-out group-hover:-translate-x-2">Keep reading</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right relative translate-x-2 opacity-0 transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out group-hover:translate-x-0 group-hover:opacity-100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)"><div class="bg-navbar flex h-full max-w-[400px] flex-col items-center justify-between rounded-lg p-6 md:items-start"><img alt="Image Banner" loading="lazy" width="1170" height="780" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mb-4 h-auto w-full" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 400px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fufyao9jy%2Fproduction%2Fda8e208acfca1909d4d6306f062c48846a0a5811-1920x1080.png%3Frect%3D150%2C0%2C1620%2C1080%26w%3D1170%26h%3D780%26auto%3Dformat%26rev%3D2026-06-23T19%253A38%253A29Z&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fufyao9jy%2Fproduction%2Fda8e208acfca1909d4d6306f062c48846a0a5811-1920x1080.png%3Frect%3D150%2C0%2C1620%2C1080%26w%3D1170%26h%3D780%26auto%3Dformat%26rev%3D2026-06-23T19%253A38%253A29Z&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fufyao9jy%2Fproduction%2Fda8e208acfca1909d4d6306f062c48846a0a5811-1920x1080.png%3Frect%3D150%2C0%2C1620%2C1080%26w%3D1170%26h%3D780%26auto%3Dformat%26rev%3D2026-06-23T19%253A38%253A29Z&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fufyao9jy%2Fproduction%2Fda8e208acfca1909d4d6306f062c48846a0a5811-1920x1080.png%3Frect%3D150%2C0%2C1620%2C1080%26w%3D1170%26h%3D780%26auto%3Dformat%26rev%3D2026-06-23T19%253A38%253A29Z&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fufyao9jy%2Fproduction%2Fda8e208acfca1909d4d6306f062c48846a0a5811-1920x1080.png%3Frect%3D150%2C0%2C1620%2C1080%26w%3D1170%26h%3D780%26auto%3Dformat%26rev%3D2026-06-23T19%253A38%253A29Z&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fufyao9jy%2Fproduction%2Fda8e208acfca1909d4d6306f062c48846a0a5811-1920x1080.png%3Frect%3D150%2C0%2C1620%2C1080%26w%3D1170%26h%3D780%26auto%3Dformat%26rev%3D2026-06-23T19%253A38%253A29Z&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fufyao9jy%2Fproduction%2Fda8e208acfca1909d4d6306f062c48846a0a5811-1920x1080.png%3Frect%3D150%2C0%2C1620%2C1080%26w%3D1170%26h%3D780%26auto%3Dformat%26rev%3D2026-06-23T19%253A38%253A29Z&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fufyao9jy%2Fproduction%2Fda8e208acfca1909d4d6306f062c48846a0a5811-1920x1080.png%3Frect%3D150%2C0%2C1620%2C1080%26w%3D1170%26h%3D780%26auto%3Dformat%26rev%3D2026-06-23T19%253A38%253A29Z&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fufyao9jy%2Fproduction%2Fda8e208acfca1909d4d6306f062c48846a0a5811-1920x1080.png%3Frect%3D150%2C0%2C1620%2C1080%26w%3D1170%26h%3D780%26auto%3Dformat%26rev%3D2026-06-23T19%253A38%253A29Z&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><h3 class="font-crimson text-tan text-2xl">weETH Bridge Security Hardening</h3><p class="py-4 text-base">On April 18th, a forged cross-chain message released ~$292M in unbacked rsETH from Kelp DAO. No EtherFi systems were directly compromised, nor did EtherFi Liquid vaults have direct exposure to rsETH. Here&#x27;s how.</p><div class="text-left"><a href="/blog/weeth-bridge-security-hardening" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed subpixel-antialiased text-14 aria-disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed border border-cream/50 text-cream disabled:opacity-40 h-11 hover:bg-navbar/70 rounded-full group px-6 md:px-10" data-zone="b99b5a"><span class="relative translate-x-[10px] transition-transform duration-500 ease-in-out group-hover:-translate-x-2">Keep reading</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right relative translate-x-2 opacity-0 transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out group-hover:translate-x-0 group-hover:opacity-100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div><div class="bg-copy/16 opacity-100 h-[1px] w-full max-w-full  " style="margin-block:2.5rem"></div><form><div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-end gap-6 md:flex-row"><p>Subscribe for the latest ether.fi updates and events</p><input type="email" placeholder="Enter your email address" required="" class="border-cream/70 h-12 w-full max-w-[268px] rounded-lg border bg-transparent px-4 py-2 text-gray-600 placeholder-gray-400 focus:border-gray-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-gray-500" value=""/><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed subpixel-antialiased text-14 aria-disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed bg-tan text-[#0E0B31] disabled:opacity-40 hover:bg-[#B29568] rounded-full h-12 px-6 font-medium md:px-10" type="submit" disabled="">Sign Up</button></div></form></div><div class="border-copy/16 flex justify-center border-t bg-cover px-[10%] py-20 text-center xl:px-[20%]" style="background-image:radial-gradient(62.12% 75.73% at 50% 111.19%, #0A0A0A 0%, #222224 59.04%, rgba(17, 17, 21, 0.59) 100%)"><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)"><h2 class="text-tan font-crimson text-5xl">Start earning today</h2><a href="/app/cash/sign-up" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed subpixel-antialiased text-14 aria-disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed